HeroDeathResurrect AI Hero Reviver
    Events
        Time - Every 2.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- Loop through each AI hero group --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in NPC_WANDERINGHORDEUNITS) Greater than 0
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet HeroDeathResurrect_HeroUnit = (Picked unit)
                Trigger - Run HeroDeathResurrect AI Hero Reviver Loop <gen> (checking conditions)
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in NPC_WANDERINGNEUTRALUNITS) Greater than 0
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet HeroDeathResurrect_HeroUnit = (Picked unit)
                Trigger - Run HeroDeathResurrect AI Hero Reviver Loop <gen> (checking conditions)
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in NPC_WANDERINGRIVERBANEUNITS) Greater than 0
